    "description": "Are you a skilled Instructional Designer looking for your next big career move? VIT University South Asia Partners in Tiruchirappalli offers you the perfect platform to grow professionally and personally.\n\nAbout VIT University South Asia Partners:\nVIT University South Asia Partners is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Conduct parent-teacher meetings and update parents on student performance\n• Contribute to school newsletter, blogs, and other publications\n• Maintain student records and prepare progress reports\n• Design formative and summative assessments aligned to learning objectives\n• Participate in teacher training and professional development programs\n• Monitor student progress and provide timely feedback\n• Participate in school events, workshops, and training programs\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Diploma or Degree in Hospitality Management\n• 1-3 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Lesson Planning\n• Proficiency in IB Curriculum\n• Proficiency in Curriculum Development\n• Proficiency in Zoom/Teams\n• Proficiency in Content Creation\n• Proficiency in Data Analysis\n• Proficiency in Communication Skills\n• Proficiency in Bloom's Taxonomy\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• Flexible working hours\n• Recognition and rewards programs\n• Salary Range: 4 LPA - 9 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Tiruchirappalli, Tamil Nadu, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with VIT University South Asia Partners!",
